- Use Prettier for all code formatting; avoid custom stylistic ESLint rules.
- Configure `.prettierrc` minimally; prefer defaults.
- Ignore build output (`.next`, `dist`) and generated files in `.prettierignore`.
- Run Prettier in CI to enforce consistent formatting.

